stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous

    Anonymous --> Refreshing: request401(generation)
    Authenticated --> Refreshing: request401(active generation)
    Authenticated --> Authenticated: request401(older generation) / retry once

    state Refreshing {
        [*] --> SingleFlight
        SingleFlight --> SingleFlight: concurrent request401 / join and deduplicate
    }

    Refreshing --> Authenticated: refreshSucceeded(new generation) / retry waiting requests once
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: refreshFailed / discard represented persisted token
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: logout / cancel represented refresh state
    Authenticated --> Anonymous: logout / discard represented persisted token
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: logout

    note right of Refreshing
      Refreshing is a conceptual state.
      coordinateRefresh returns only
      anonymous or authenticated.
      Fernando's HTTP coordinator owns
      the real shared Promise and retry.
    end note

    note right of Authenticated
      refreshSucceeded.generation identifies
      the newly active credentials; it need
      not equal request401.generation.
    end note
